      "role": "user",
      "content": "That sounds like a much better angle. If we lean into that \"high-resolution/depth\" narrative, do you think we can actually omit the explicit mention of the small sample size in the abstract or the main discussion? I just want to make sure the core findings get the attention they deserve without being overshadowed by a statistical technicality.",
